      "section": "Underside of countertop to floor",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 322.3484,
        "t": 180.66498,
        "r": 568.2133703999999,
        "b": 163.0246973529412
      },
      "content": "The enclosure must be at least 24\" (61 cm) wide, 24\" (61 cm) deep, and 32½\" (82.5 cm) high."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0125",
      "reading_order": 144,
      "section": "Underside of countertop to floor",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 322.3529188,
        "t": 158.7622338,
        "r": 554.5965612000001,
        "b": 131.16692035294113
      },
      "content": "For the front door of the dishwasher to be flush with the leading edge of the counter top, the counter top must be at least 24\" (61 cm) deep."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0126",
      "reading_order": 145,
      "section": "Underside of countertop to floor",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 322.3529188,
        "t": 126.90445680000005,
        "r": 563.3697718000002,
        "b": 97.31971255294116
      },
      "content": "This dishwasher is designed to be enclosed on the top and on both sides by a standard residential kitchen cabinet unit. The installation enclosure must be clean and free of any"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0127",
      "reading_order": 146,
      "section": "Underside of countertop to floor",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 322.3529188,
        "t": 95.04667979999999,
        "r": 374.80399300000005,
        "b": 87.36359715294122
      },
      "content": "obstructions."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0128",
      "reading_order": 147,
      "section": "Underside of countertop to floor",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 322.3484,
        "t": 83.08478000000002,
        "r": 573.390688,
        "b": 55.48739735294123
      },
      "content": "NOTE: ADA installation, 32½\" (82.5 cm) beneath 34\" (86.4 cm) high countertops may be accomplished by adjusting the toekick and leveling legs."
